        "original_id": "d2f95ebb-dce3-5850-a02e-d81ca64df8f2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ray Wilson, Leo, Ravi\n- Music groups: Stiltskin, Genesis, VIXX, VIXX LR\n- Companies: Jellyfish Entertainment\n- Products: Darkest Angels\n\nFacts:\n- Ray Wilson was born on 8 September 1968 and is a Scottish musician.\n- Ray Wilson was the vocalist in Stiltskin and in Genesis from 1996 to 1998.\n- Leo, born Jung Taek-woon on 10 November 1990, is a South Korean singer, songwriter, and musical theatre actor.\n- Leo is signed under Jellyfish Entertainment.\n- VIXX LR was established in August 2015.\n- VIXX LR consists of VIXX members Leo, the main vocalist, and Ravi, the main rapper.\n- Darkest Angels is the first compilation album by the South Korean boy band VIXX.",
